<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Feb precious metals import prices up.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Feb precious metals import prices up.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's precious metals import prices rose in February due to gains in world markets, the Association of Foreign Trading Agents of Korea (AFTAK) said on Monday.</p>
<p>Import prices of precious metals were as follows:</p>
<p>(US$ a tonne CIF)</p>
<p> METAL		  Feb	 Jan</p>
<p> Gold (gram)	  $11.33    $11.57</p>
<p> Silver (Kg)	 $168.94   $155.99</p>
<p> Platinum (t/oz)   $376.20   $348.86</p>
<p> Palladium (t/oz)  $122.62   $116.47</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom, (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
